  "notes": [
    "PCPG rarity is independently source-qualified, but its GRI-specific selection is post-result; it is therefore a P0-D rare-natural limit testbed with no confirmatory weight.",
    "Function and Limit maps are coequal research targets and neither overrides the other.",
    "WORKS_HERE, STOPS_WORKING_HERE, and NOT_KNOWN_HERE must always carry an explicit scope/component referent.",
